Use this API to fetch stock of the products in Anchanto WMS. By calling this API, users can retrieve information about the current inventory levels of various products in the warehouse.

      ### 📋 Request Template (Copy & Paste)
      ```json
      {
        "fetch": [
          { "sku": "SKU123" },
          { "sku": "SKU456" }
        ]
      }
      ```

Update warehouse-specific stock settings for a product. This API allows users to configure inventory thresholds, buffer stocks, and unit limits to ensure optimal stock levels in the specified warehouse.

      ### 📋 Request Template (Copy & Paste)
      ```json
      {
        "product": {
          "sku": "PROD-001",
          "stock_info": {
            "low_threshold": 10,
            "buffer_stock": 5,
            "min_no_of_units": 1,
            "max_no_of_units": 1000,
            "is_voos": false
          }
        }
      }
      ```

